---
// Quiz figure for Post 6: Core operating profit vs one-off gain on Income Statement.
---
<div class="qfig-sbq06pq">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 185" role="img" aria-label="Income Statement of Company B showing Net Revenue down 15%, Gross Profit squeezed to 95B, Core Operating loss −22B, and a +210B one-off gain lifting Net Profit to +150B.">
    <text x="16" y="24" class="qfig-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Company B Income Statement Breakdown (billion VND)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bóc tách Kết quả kinh doanh Công ty B (tỷ đồng)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="16" y="44" width="262" height="124" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="32" y="72" class="qfig-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Core Operations</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hoạt động cốt lõi</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="100">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Net Revenue: 750B (−15% YoY)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Doanh thu thuần: 750 tỷ (−15%)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="126">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Gross Profit: 95B (12.7% margin)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Lợi nhuận gộp: 95 tỷ (12,7%)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="152" class="qfig-t qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Core Operating Profit: −22B</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Lãi hoạt động chính: −22 tỷ</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="302" y="44" width="262" height="124" rx="8" class="qfig-card-red" />
    <text x="318" y="72" class="qfig-t qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Non-Recurring &amp; Bottom Line</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Đột biến &amp; Lãi ròng cuối bảng</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="100">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One-off subsidiary sale: +210B</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Lãi bán công ty con 1 lần: +210 tỷ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="126">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Corporate Income Tax: −38B</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thuế TNDN: −38 tỷ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="152" class="qfig-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Reported Net Profit: +150B</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>LNST công bố: +150 tỷ</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq06pq { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq06pq svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq06pq text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq06pq .qfig-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq06pq .qfig-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq06pq .qfig-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-sbq06pq .qfig-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-sbq06pq .qfig-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
</style>
